steps.text:
The wall is up. Now watch what Black's king is able to do about the pawn.

{{Kc6}} {{Kf4}} {{Kc5}} {{Kf5}}

Four moves. Black's king has walked down the c-file and still cannot set foot on the d-file, because every square of it belongs to a rook on d1. White's king, meanwhile, has walked up beside its pawn, which is what escort means.
